{"id":"103c46119106d8a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-normal-function.md","title":"ZFC Normal Function","display":"df-zfc-normal-function — ZFC Normal Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-normal-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-normal-function","58-df-zfc-ord-normal-function"],"display":"df-zfc-normal-function — ZFC Normal Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-normal-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-normal-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-ord-normal-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-normal-function — ZFC Normal Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\kappa\\in V,\\quad\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(F,\\kappa\\in V,\\quad\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalFunction}_S(F,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;(F(\\alpha)&lt;F(\\beta))\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to F(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}F(\\alpha)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalFunction}_S(F,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;(F(\\alpha)&lt;F(\\beta))\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to F(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}F(\\alpha)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuity is imposed only at limit ordinals; imposing it at successors would contradict strict monotonicity.</li>\n<li>The ordinal normal-function variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,\\kappa\\in V,\\quad\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalFunction}_S(F,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\beta<\\kappa\\;(F(\\alpha)<F(\\beta))\\land\\forall\\lambda<\\kappa\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to F(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}F(\\alpha)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1117,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2837","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-normal-function.md|58-df-zfc-normal-function]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}